WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.050
Melting and boiling take energy in; freezing and condensing give it out.

2
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.250
Ice: the particles vibrate in fixed places.

3
00:00:11.036 --> 00:00:15.686
Put energy in: the particles move faster and break free. Melting.

4
00:00:16.577 --> 00:00:20.677
More energy, and they escape each other completely. Boiling.

5
00:00:21.252 --> 00:00:25.427
Cool it, and the energy comes back out: condensing, then freezing.
